    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      417.92,
      286.44,
      618.32
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act that the Government intend to acquire the following land/Servitude* which is required for a public purpose: Description of the land to be acquired: The allotment of the land in extent of about 0.0600 Hectare shown in F.V.P. 1399 additional Paper No. prepared by the Survey Superintendent, situated in the Village of Allakattuwa in the sub Division of Nuwaragam Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nuwaragam Palatha Central, in the District of Anuradhapura. F.V.P. 1399",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      618.84,
      286.43,
      663.48
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. A part of Lot No. 273 \u2014 Name of the land : Allakattuwatta; Claimant: Mrs. Chandrani Liyanage, Ven Vajira Dhammacharini Silmatha; Extent of land: 0.0600 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      539.38,
      367.28
    ],
    "text": "Boundary: North: Lot No. 266; East: A part of Lot No. 273;South: Lot No. 274;West: Lot No. 272.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      368.72,
      539.36,
      459.2
    ],
    "text": "All persons who have claims for the ownership or any other interest for the above land are requested to meet me on 28th day of June, 2017 at 9.30 a.m. at the Divisional Secretary office of Nuwaragam Palatha Central. In case of persons who need to make representations on behalf of them, are request to authorize their nominees with a letter of consent for such representations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      460.64,
      539.37,
      597.2
    ],
    "text": "In addition, all claimants are requested to submit their claims in duplicate on or before 21st day of June, 2017 giving information on the nature of the claims, justification for the request required amount of compensation method of compensation calculation (how was the amount calculated) with plan number and lot number of the land. G. A. KITHSIRI, Divisional Secretary. Nuwaragam Palatha Central.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
